<title>PORTUGAL: Yield on Portugal 5-yr bonds dips to 6.4578 pct.</title>
<headline>Yield on Portugal 5-yr bonds dips to 6.4578 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the result of the Portuguese Treasury's auction of 20 billion escudos of five-year fixed-rate bonds (OT).</p>
<p>ISSUER: Republic of Portugal</p>
<p>AMOUNT PLACED 15.6 BLN ESC</p>
<p>MATURITY: 23/3/01  COUPON: 8.75</p>
<p>AVERAGE ACCEPTED YIELD: 6.457756</p>
<p>HIGHEST ACCEPTED YIELD: 6.46</p>
<p>LOWEST ACCEPTED YIELD: 6.45</p>
<p>PAYMENT FREQUENCY: ANNUAL</p>
<p>NOTES: The issue is fungible. The auction takes to 255.96 billion escudos the total amount of the bonds issued.</p>
</text>
